    "result": "I fixed the regression in `sqlparse/formatter.py`. I haven't run the tests, including the four that were failing.\n\nThe check that decides whether to attach the output-format filter was inverted. It was `if not (fltr is not None):`, so the Python and PHP filters were built and then never added. Only an unrecognised format ever got a filter, and that filter was `None`. I changed it to `if fltr is not None:`.\n\nI didn't touch `sqlparse/filters/output.py`. The filter classes there look correct."
  },
